Package: emeans
Title: Fast Unsupervised Subtyping of Expression Data with e-means
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dingkang", "Zhao", email = "dingkang.25@intl.zju.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Unsupervised disease subtyping for bulk expression matrices.
    Clusters samples with the e-means algorithm, an exponential-moving-average
    variant of k-means that uses cosine-annealed step sizes, dead-cluster
    revival and a last-epoch averaging pass, and exposes a one-call interface
    that takes a genes-by-samples matrix and returns per-sample subtype labels
    together with expression centroids, silhouette diagnostics, marker genes
    and a predictor for new samples. Preprocessing (median imputation,
    zero-variance filtering, gene-wise z-scores and PCA) is applied
    internally. The method is described in Bessa, Mazare, Szilvasy, Touvron,
    Picard, Douze and Jegou (2026) <https://e-means.github.io>.
